Changes made relative to upstream commit ef0272a4ecd886a7e62cd3b65dd22a010cd36b62:

  - Upstream's source-available code, which it keeps under directories named
    "proprietary", is not included. This repository carries only the portion of
    upstream licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
  - Modules supplying the interfaces that code provided were written for this
    fork and placed at the same import paths. They implement panel sign-in
    through Google and GitHub, and audit logging. SSO against arbitrary identity
    providers, SCIM, custom roles, whitelabeling and application forward auth are
    not implemented. No licence gating is performed.
  - apps/dokploy/pages/index.tsx and apps/dokploy/pages/register.tsx render the
    social sign-in buttons on self-hosted panels.
  - Release automation targets this fork's own container registry.

UPSTREAM.md records the base commit and the procedure for syncing upstream
changes.
